rlo, ma la polizia, allertata da una denuncia, uccide l'uomo. Prima di morire questi rivela a Pip di essere il padre di Estella. Adattamento ammirevole, per sensibilità e finezza, dell'universo dickensiano, dei suoi temi e delle sue atmosfere","language":"it-IT"},"tagline":{"value":"From the Vivid Pages of Charles Dickens' Masterpiece!","language":"en-US"},"releaseDate":"1946-12-26","status":"Released","rating":7.3,"ratingCount":391,"genres":["Dramma","Romance"],"countries":["United Kingdom"],"facts":{"Runtime":"118m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":11859,"name":"John Mills","role":"Pip","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jMqhI1NeTwgdKsrj9vMshk1r5hP.jpg"},{"id":2924,"name":"Valerie Hobson","role":"Estella","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1sfD32ahPZwDIcWUIlx4tFG8fnr.jpg"},{"id":1296266,"name":"Tony Wager","role":"Young Pip","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u3oKC0HAuKPdTiRyZY0SzdvgotS.jpg"},{"id":14500,"name":"Jean Simmons","role":"Young Estella","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/scbR91Bl4SbfQqhXaH6OfhjxfYt.jpg"},{"id":8239,"name":"Bernard Miles","role":"Joe Gargery","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wcg0mbHJEU7IXK5lihpMXEVy0jn.jpg"},{"id":93900,"name":"Francis L. Sullivan","role":"Mr. Jaggers","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2KazUac8mYnhqvV6hzTiuj2q4rs.jpg"},{"id":10027,"name":"Finlay Currie","role":"Abel Magwitch","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/okHKOxm5wmFu513NsK3JNI7fMkr.jpg"},{"id":20127,"name":"Martita Hunt","role":"Miss Havisham","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aMndarFsZg4gOfkbnZ51qhmJ57H.jpg"},{"id":12248,"name":"Alec Guinness","role":"Herbert Pocket","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qaN3cZdd2pvKaOXIIJ5BXnbjPp3.jpg"},{"id":89209,"name":"Ivor Barnard","role":"Mr. Wemmick","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cgkH1MwlmCIzcLg5K2CVRYT13GY.jpg"},{"id":39002,"name":"Freda Jackson","role":"Mrs. Joe","profi